* pll_models.lib - device models for the discrete USB 2.0 PLL board (ngspice)
*
* BFR93A   Siemens / Infineon BFR93A (SOT-23) Gummel-Poon chip data, extracted by
*          IMST for Siemens Small Signal Semiconductors (datasheet Dec-12-1996,
*          "SPICE Parameters (Gummel-Poon Model, Berkeley-SPICE 2G.6 Syntax)"),
*          with the package equivalent circuit of the same datasheet (LBI/LBO,
*          LEI/LEO, LCO, CBE, CCB, CCE; valid up to 6 GHz).
*          subckt pins: C B E
* SV305    Toshiba 1SV305 varactor (SOD-523), fitted to the datasheet:
*          C(1 V) = 18.3 pF, C(4 V) = 6.1 pF (C1V/C4V = 3.0), rs = 0.27 Ohm at
*          470 MHz, IR <= 3 nA at 10 V, VR max 10 V.  Hyperabrupt: M > 1.
*          Package: 0.4 nH, 0.05 pF.  subckt pins: A K
* LQW18_10N  Murata LQW18AN10NG00 (0603 wire-wound, 10 nH +-2 %): Q about 50
*          at 500 MHz (datasheet Q min 35 at 250 MHz), SRF > 4 GHz.  pins: 1 2
* The ADF4002 (PFD / charge pump / counters), the CDCM1804 dividers and the
* MCP6001 buffer are behavioural in the testbenches (run_sims.py), with the
* datasheet values listed there.

.model BFR93A_chip NPN (IS=8.6752e-15 BF=137.63 NF=0.93633 VAF=20.011 IKF=0.33395
+ ISE=2.6193e-12 NE=1.5466 BR=59 NR=0.88761 VAR=26.834 IKR=0.015129 ISC=0.70823e-15
+ NC=1.95 RB=7.2326 IRB=0.043806e-3 RBM=3.4649 RE=1.0075 RC=0.13193
+ CJE=3.1538e-15 VJE=0.70393 MJE=0.5071 TF=33.388e-12 XTF=0.28319 VTF=0.17765
+ ITF=2.5184e-3 PTF=0 CJC=1.0395e-12 VJC=0.72744 MJC=0.34565 XCJC=0.21422
+ TR=1.1061e-9 CJS=0 VJS=0.75 MJS=0 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 FC=0.75935 TNOM=26.85)

.subckt BFR93A c b e
LBO b b1 0.51n
LBI b1 bi 0.85n
LEO e e1 0.61n
LEI e1 ei 0.69n
LCO c ci 0.49n
CBE b1 e1 73f
CCB b1 ci 84f
CCE ci e1 165f
Q1 ci bi ei BFR93A_chip
.ends

.model SV305_d D (IS=1e-14 N=1.05 RS=0.27 CJO=47.9p VJ=0.7 M=1.084 FC=0.5 BV=10 IBV=1u EG=1.11 XTI=3)
.subckt SV305 a k
LP a a1 0.4n
CP a k 0.05p
D1 a1 k SV305_d
.ends

.subckt LQW18_10N 1 2
L1 1 m 10n
R1 m 2 0.63
C1 1 2 0.08p
.ends

* tolerance copies of LQW18_10N (+-2 %), used by the vcotol_* cases only
.subckt LQW18_10N_m2 1 2
L1 1 m 9.8n
R1 m 2 0.62
C1 1 2 0.08p
.ends
.subckt LQW18_10N_p2 1 2
L1 1 m 10.2n
R1 m 2 0.64
C1 1 2 0.08p
.ends
